2-24-2026



Solution:
You must use a full secret key (sk_live_...) for STRIPE_SECRET_KEY in your .env file. The rk_live key will not work for secure checkout.

Would you like to update your .env with a valid sk_live key, or do you need help generating one from your Stripe dashboard?

# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=your_sk_live_key_here
# (Set your Stripe secret key securely in your deployment environment, not in public files)
****************************************************************************************
Where You Update Your Stripe Secret Key
Your real Stripe secret key (sk_live_...) NEVER goes into GitHub.

You update it ONLY in Vercel → Project Settings → Environment Variables.

In Vercel, add:
Key	Value	Visibility
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY	sk_live_...	Server-side only
NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY	pk_live_...	Public
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET	whsec_...	Server-side only


